<details id="water-disclaimer" class="card coverage"><summary>Water data disclaimer, sources and dates</summary><p>Water figures are from the official JJM report retrieved from 13 October 2026; each linked record retains its retrieval timestamp. The source does not state an observation date. Tap connections do not establish regular supply or drinking-water safety. JJM household counts remain separate from Census counts.</p><p>Village links use exact JJM and LGD IDs published in the official B37(A) live mapping, archived with retrieval dates. Final approval in B37(B) has not been verified. Original JJM, LGD, Census and SOI identifiers and polygons are preserved.</p><p>The October 2026 national release contains 580,395 linked village records across 34 JJM state/UT groups, alongside the existing Pilibhit snapshot. Coverage gaps remain: 2,609 report rows have LGD IDs absent from the current platform directory, 561 have ambiguous official mappings, and 60 Thoubal rows lack an available official mapping. Purbi Champaran reports could not be retrieved from the official service (1,244 listed villages). Two village IDs with conflicting district reports are withheld. Delhi and Chandigarh were not listed in this rural JJM source. Map coverage also depends on an existing verified polygon link. An unavailable map value means that no matched record is currently published; it does not mean zero tap connections.</p><p><a href="https://ejalshakti.gov.in/JJM/JJMReports/lgd_Mapping/rpt_LGDMappedStatus.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official JJM–LGD mapping source ↗</a></p></details>

